BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:One of Our Own: A Tribute to Joan Roca
DTSTART:20260513T010000Z
DTEND:20260513T022500Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T010000Z
UID:8CdFov6Nts
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 70 mins (1h10m)\n\nCatalan chef Joan Roca\, hailed a
 s the “Messi of the kitchen\,” is a revolutionary force in gastronomy.
  Twenty of Spain’s top chefs\, together holding 70 Michelin stars\, unit
 e to craft an extraordinary banquet celebrating Roca’s generosity\, visi
 on\, and pioneering culinary genius.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/one-
 of-our-own-a-tribute-to-joan-roca\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tell Everyone
DTSTART:20260513T033000Z
DTEND:20260513T054000Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T033000Z
UID:QCyd6RR917
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nOn a remote island where trouble
 some women are sent to be forgotten\, an emotionally charged struggle for 
 liberation unfolds in a dazzlingly beautiful and deeply moving historical 
 drama.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/tell-everyone\n\nEstimated start: 
 20:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
